	Abstract = {This contribution reviews recent results on the dynamics of YSO jets obtained by the JETSET network using theoretical MHD models, numerical simulations, and laboratory experiments. Topics include pressure-driven stellar winds, magnetospheric ejections, disk winds, MRI and KH instabilities, turbulence injection, molecular outflow formation, and MHD code development and testing.},
