	Abstract = {Cross sections and rate coefficients have been calculated for the rotational excitation of CO by ground state ortho- and para-H2. The quantum-mechanical-coupled-channels method was used, without significant approximations other than the finite size of the basis sets. For collisions with ortho-H2, rotational levels of CO j<=20 were included, and j<=29 for collisions with para-H2. Comparison is made with recent calculations by Mengel et al (2001 Can. J. Phys. at press).},
